 is one of the world's leading experts in the field of Rett Syndrome treatment with over 30 years of clinical and research experience. His scientific output includes 38 focused articles on Rett Syndrome with over 1,200 citations in total, indicating his significant influence in this field.\" — Topic content - knowledge base text for AI reference. May be empty if topic is just a category.\n      - subtopics: {map} — Nested subtopics under this topic. View to see available subtopics. \n          (may contain items - view \"/Context_Library/A comprehensive list of articles on Rett Syndrome by Prof. Meir Lotan/subtopics\" to load from database)\n      - active: (not in schema)\n      ↪ To expand: view \"/Context_Library/A comprehensive list of articles on Rett Syndrome by Prof. Meir Lotan/*\". (read-only)\n  - Physiotherapy Goals - Gross Motor Skills: {object}\n      - id: \"f0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\" — Topic UUID (for internal reference)\n      - title: \"Physiotherapy Goals - Gross Motor Skills\" — Topic title\n      - content: \"Individual Physiotherapy Learning Plans (תוכנית לימוד אישית - פיזיותרפיה) for pediatric gross motor development. These structured therapy goal templates are used in Israeli special education (TALA) settings for children with motor development needs. Each goal includes: Long-term objectives, intervention methods, prerequisites/conditions, success criteria, and designated implementers (physiotherapist and/or educational team).\" — Topic content - knowledge base text for AI reference. May be empty if topic is just a category.\n      - subtopics: {map} — Nested subtopics under this topic. View to see available subtopics. \n          (may contain items - view \"/Context_Library/Physiotherapy Goals - Gross Motor Skills/subtopics\" to load from database)\n      - active: (not in schema)\n      ↪ To expand: view \"/Context_Library/Physiotherapy Goals - Gross Motor Skills/*\". (read-only)\n  - Preschool SLP Goals Bank: {object}\n      - id: \"1ab6aeb0-36fd-4875-bda3-1c100f3c6446\" — Topic UUID (for internal reference)\n      - title: \"Preschool SLP Goals Bank\" — Topic title\n      - content: \"Preschool SLP Goals Bank\" — Topic content - knowledge base text for AI reference. May be empty if topic is just a category.\n      - subtopics: {map} — Nested subtopics under this topic. View to see available subtopics. \n          (may contain items - view \"/Context_Library/Preschool SLP Goals Bank/subtopics\" to load from database)\n      - active: (not in schema)\n      ↪ To expand: view \"/Context_Library/Preschool SLP Goals Bank/*\". (read-only)\n• /Context_Program (object) — The current educational program for the student \n  - id: \"6c92a454-ab2b-45af-8c0b-4f1de38db269\"\n  - framework: \"tala\" [\"tala\" | \"us_iep\"] — TALA (Israel) or US IEP framework\n  - title: \"Gal's Educational Program 2026\"\n  - status: \"active\" [\"draft\" | \"active\" | \"archived\"]\n  - startDate: \"2026-01-07\"\n  - endDate: \"2026-12-31\"\n  - dueDate: \"2025-11-15\"\n  - approvalDate: null\n  - leastRestrictiveEnvironment: null\n  - notes: null\n  - profileDomains: {map} — Functional profile / PLAAFP documentation (keyed by domain type). Unless requested, there should only be one domain per type. \n      (may contain items - view \"/Context_Program/profileDomains\" to load from database)\n      ↪ Add: action \"add\" at \"/Context_Program/profileDomains\" with key + value.\n  - goals: {map} — Annual goals with objectives. Goals are linked to domains through their objectives (each objective can have a profileDomainId). Goals should be defined using S.M.A.R.T criteria. \n      (may contain items - view \"/Context_Program/goals\" to load from database)\n      ↪ Add: action \"add\" at \"/Context_Program/goals\" with key + value.\n  - studentId: (not in schema)\n  - instituteId: (not in schema)\n  - metadata: (not in schema)\n  - services: (not in schema)\n  - teamMembers: (not in schema)\n  - meetings: (not in schema)\n  - consentForms: (not in schema)\n  - progressReports: (not in schema)\n  ↪ To expand: view \"/Context_Program/*\". To modify: action \"set\" on \"/Context_Program\" or \"/Context_Program/<property>\".\n• /Context_Reports (object) — Available reports: Medical records (editable), Functional reports (editable), Educational reports (editable). \n  - medicalRecord: {object} — Current medical record for the student. Contains diagnoses, allergies, medications, and medical alerts. (hidden)\n  - archivedMedicalRecords: {array} — Previously finalized medical records (read-only). View these to see historical medical information. (empty)\n  - functionalReport: {object} — Current functional report for the student. Contains mobility, ADL status, sensory profile, and safety risks. (hidden)\n  - archivedFunctionalReports: {array} — Previously finalized functional reports (read-only). (empty)\n  - educationalReport: {object} — Current educational report for the student. Contains communication modes, language abilities, technology used, and behavioral strategies. (empty)\n  - archivedEducationalReports: {array} — Previously finalized educational reports (read-only). (empty)\n  ↪ To expand: view \"/Context_Reports/*\". To modify: action \"set\" on \"/Context_Reports\" or \"/Context_Reports/<property>\".\n\nAllowed roots & types: /User_AiPersonalityPreferences{string}, /User_Language{string}, /Student_People{array}, /Student_Interests{array}, /Student_CommunicationStyle{object}, /Student_Preferences{object}, /Student_Notes{array}, /Relationship_Notes{array}, /Context_Institutes{map}, /Context_Students{map}, /Context_Library{map}, /Context_Program{object}, /Context_Reports{object}\nOperate only on visible paths or their parent container. To reveal children:\n  manageMemory { \"ops\": [ { \"action\": \"view\", \"path\": \"/path/*\" } ] }\nPagination: include { \"page\": { \"offset\": N, \"limit\": M } } in a view op on a container.\n\n=== Schema Hints (add/insert/upsert in current scope) ===\n• /Student_People — ARRAY of object\n  item.required: [Name]\n  item.props: Name:string, Relationship:string\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Student_People\",\"value\": {\"Name\":\"text\"} }] }\n• /Student_Interests — ARRAY of string\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Student_Interests\",\"value\": \"text\" }] }\n• /Student_Preferences/FavoriteActivities — ARRAY of string\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Student_Preferences/FavoriteActivities\",\"value\": \"text\" }] }\n• /Student_Preferences/RewardPreferences — ARRAY of string\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Student_Preferences/RewardPreferences\",\"value\": \"text\" }] }\n• /Student_Preferences/AvoidTopics — ARRAY of string\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Student_Preferences/AvoidTopics\",\"value\": \"text\" }] }\n• /Student_Notes — ARRAY of string\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Student_Notes\",\"value\": \"text\" }] }\n• /Context_Institutes — MAP<string, object>\n  value.required: [name, type]\n  value.props: id:string, name:string, type:string [enum: \"school\", \"hospital\"], description:string, address:string, phone:string, email:string, website:string, isActive:boolean, membership:{object}, members:map<string, object>, students:map<string, object> … +2 more\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Context_Institutes\",\"key\":\"<key>\",\"value\": {\"name\":\"text\",\"type\":\"text\"} }] }\n• /Context_Students — MAP<string, object>\n  value.required: [name]\n  value.props: id:string, name:string, firstName:string, lastName:string, gender:string [enum: \"male\", \"female\", \"other\"], birthDate:string [format YYYY-MM-DD], framework:string [enum: \"tala\", \"us_iep\"], country:string, primaryLanguage:string, additionalLanguages:array<string>, isActive:boolean, link:{object} … +3 more\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Context_Students\",\"key\":\"<key>\",\"value\": {\"name\":\"text\"} }] }\n• /Context_Library — MAP<string, object>\n  value.props: id:string, title:string, content:string, subtopics:map<string, object>\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Context_Library\",\"key\":\"<key>\",\"value\": {} }] }\n• /Context_Program/profileDomains — MAP<string, object>\n  value.required: [domainType]\n  value.props: id:string, domainType:string [enum: \"cognitive_academic\", \"communication_language\", \"social_emotional_behavioral\", \"motor_sensory\", \"life_skills_preparation\", \"other\"], customName:string, strengths:string, needs:string, impactStatement:string, adverseEffectStatement:string, sortOrder:integer, baselineMeasurements:array<object>, assessmentSources:array<object>\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Context_Program/profileDomains\",\"key\":\"<key>\",\"value\": {\"domainType\":\"text\"} }] }\n• /Context_Program/goals — MAP<string, object>\n  value.required: [goalStatement]\n  value.props: id:string, goalStatement:string, status:string [enum: \"draft\", \"active\", \"achieved\", \"modified\", \"discontinued\"], progress:integer [min 0; max 100], targetDate:string [format YYYY-MM-DD], achievedDate:string [format YYYY-MM-DD], targetBehavior:string, criteria:string, methods:string, measurementMethod:string, relevance:string, interventionLevel:string [enum: \"activity\", \"function\", \"participation\"] … +3 more\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Context_Program/goals\",\"key\":\"<key>\",\"value\": {\"goalStatement\":\"text\"} }] }\n• /Context_Reports/archivedMedicalRecords — ARRAY of object\n  item.props: id:string, status:string [enum: \"draft\", \"pending_review\", \"final\", \"superseded\"], primaryDiagnosis:string, primaryDiagnosisCode:string, coMorbidities:array<string>, secondaryDiagnoses:array<string>, alertsAllergies:array<string>, alertsSeizures:array<string>, alertsCardiac:array<string>, medications:array<string>, medicalEquipment:array<string>\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Context_Reports/archivedMedicalRecords\",\"value\": {} }] }\n• /Context_Reports/archivedFunctionalReports — ARRAY of object\n  item.props: id:string, status:string [enum: \"draft\", \"pending_review\", \"final\", \"superseded\"], mobilityStatus:array<string>, adlStatus:array<string>, sensoryProfile:array<string>, safetyRisks:array<string>\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Context_Reports/archivedFunctionalReports\",\"value\": {} }] }\n• /Context_Reports/archivedEducationalReports — ARRAY of object\n  item.props: id:string, status:string [enum: \"draft\", \"pending_review\", \"final\", \"superseded\"], communicationMode:array<string>, receptiveLanguage:array<string>, assistiveTechnologyUsed:array<string>, reinforcers:array<string>, preferredActivities:array<string>, behavioralStrategies:array<string>\n  e.g. add → manageMemory { \"ops\":[{ \"action\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/Context_Reports/archivedEducationalReports\",\"value\": {} }] }\n\nNotes:\n- When item/value is an OBJECT, include all listed \"required\" keys when creating it.\n- Arrays/maps may enforce limits (uniqueItems, min/max counts) and map keys may have regex constraints.\n- For topics, \"value\" may be a string (description) or a full node {description?, subtopics?}."
